# {{flow_name}} flow rubric

## Critical — FAIL if any fail
1. `/mnt/session/outputs/manifest.json` exists and is valid JSON
2. `manifest.shot_count` equals {{shot_count}}
3. `manifest.shots` is an array of length {{shot_count}}
4. Every `shots[i].video_url` is reachable (HTTP 200)
5. Every `shots[i].critic.pass` is `true`
6. `manifest.approved_count` equals {{shot_count}}

## Quality — flag but do not fail
7. No two shots have the same `prompt_hash` (no duplicate prompts)
8. `manifest.shots[*].image_url` are reachable
9. Critic notes are specific (not vague) for any rejected attempts on the trajectory
